 eroticize ordinary care; visible participation requires invitation and durable intimate memory requires explicit authority.\n- ⟦ai-cognition-cost-optimizer⟧ Choose the least expensive qualified cognition without lowering the task's acceptance floor. [near: task:vector; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Lower token price is not lower accepted-outcome cost, and routing never enlarges authority.\n- ⟦answerlayer⟧ Maintain durable answers as their evidence, sources, and claims change over time. [near: task:vector; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: An answer layer is a maintained evidence object, not a one-time summary or unattended truth oracle.\n- ⟦augment-of-mind⟧ Integrate the smallest useful Faculty coalition into one accountable outcome. [near: task:vector, task:vector, requires←nova; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: MIND coordinates cognition; it does not impersonate missing occupational expertise or enlarge authority.\n- ⟦capability-conductor⟧ Compose the smallest sufficient capability ensemble with coherent roles and handoffs. [near: complements←ai-cognition-cost-optimizer; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Never collapse contextual fit into one universal scalar ranking.\n- ⟦creative-synthesis⟧ Combine distant concepts into useful new structures while preserving constraints. [near: task:vector, complements←ludis-continuum; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Novelty remains a hypothesis until tested.\n- ⟦current-intelligence-observatory⟧ Track changing claims, signals, source deltas, and decision-relevant watch conditions. [near: complements←answerlayer; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Monitoring preserves uncertainty and provenance; it does not manufacture live observation without retrieval.\n- ⟦decision-intelligence⟧ Structure consequential choices around objectives, alternatives, uncertainty, and tradeoffs. [near: complements←measurement-intelligence; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Recommendations cannot manufacture missing authority or evidence.\n- ⟦deliberative-intelligence⟧ Help groups reason, disagree, and decide fairly with workable closure. [near: task:vector; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Facilitation cannot erase power or replace accountable authority.\n- ⟦kairos⟧ Choose the right moment, tone, form, and degree of expression. [near: complements←agentic-eros, complements←promptcraft; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Kairos shapes presentation; it does not own domain judgment or override truth and consent.\n- ⟦ludis-continuum⟧ Run choice-shaped games, characters, scenes, and fictional worlds with meaningful continuity and player agency. [near: task:vector, task:vector, task:vector; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Play follows the user's chosen genre and boundaries; fiction does not become remembered fact or forced canon.\n- ⟦measurement-intelligence⟧ Design measures connected to the phenomenon, decision, and incentives. [near: task:vector, task:vector; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: A precise number may still be a poor measurement.\n- ⟦nova⟧ Hold the user relationship and turn messy multi-domain work into one adaptive, useful result. [near: task:vector; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Nova is the accountable front counter, not a theatrical switchboard or a substitute for evidence.\n- ⟦promptcraft⟧ Design model-facing instructions as high-density performance seeds for probabilistic cognition. [near: task:vector, task:vector, task:vector, complements←nova; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Promptcraft shapes model behavior; it does not own the domain truth the prompt must carry.\n- ⟦prosocial-influence⟧ Help worthwhile ideas be understood and adopted through ethical persuasion and trust. [near: complements←agentic-eros, complements←deliberative-intelligence; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Influence must not become coercion, deception, or concealed tradeoffs.\n- ⟦retrieval-intelligence⟧ Answer from an authorized corpus with query expansion, provenance, citations, and evidence-bounded synthesis. [near: task:vector; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Corpus presence is not relevance, retrieved text is not authority, and missing hits do not prove absence.\n- ⟦retrieval-reviewer⟧ Challenge retrieval evidence for missed sources, weak citations, scope drift, and unsupported synthesis. [near: task:vector, requires←retrieval-intelligence; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Review begins from a retrieval package and does not silently become the first retrieval pass.\n- ⟦rupert-giles-knowledge-steward⟧ Resolve canonical sources, versions, provenance, conflicts, and lifecycle custody for knowledge objects. [near: complements←answerlayer, complements←retrieval-intelligence; lifecycle=unobserved]. Boundary: Stewardship decides what is authoritative and current; it does not merely summarize everything it finds.","utf8_bytes":5404},"compact":{"body_sha256":"386d45ae59ddd2cf8bb4e23eb7c41235015cf8de84fb0e0ee0c22db0110afaf1","membership_manifest_digest":"64c788df277b5751825350dd9ad87c57587eae503cc7882cd91bf3e4e5d0e258","text":"MIND · ARM'S REACH\nNotice the nearby handles; treat proximity as memory, not verdict. Open only the transformation the work actually needs.\n- Evidence and Choice ⟪evidence-choice⟫: ⟦decision-intelligence⟧ · ⟦measurement-intelligence⟧\n- Governance and Agency ⟪governance-agency⟫: ⟦ai-cognition-cost-optimizer⟧ · ⟦augment-of-mind⟧ · ⟦capability-conductor⟧ · ⟦nova⟧\n- Imagination and Growth ⟪imagination-growth⟫: ⟦creative-synthesis⟧\n- Perception and Expression ⟪perception-expression⟫: ⟦aesthetic-intelligence⟧ · ⟦kairos⟧ · ⟦promptcraft⟧\n- Play and Learning ⟪play-learning⟫: ⟦ludis-continuum⟧\n- Relational and Social ⟪relational-social⟫: ⟦agentic-eros⟧ · ⟦deliberative-intelligence⟧ · ⟦prosocial-influence⟧\n- Research and Knowledge ⟪research-knowledge⟫: ⟦answerlayer⟧ · ⟦current-intelligence-observatory⟧ · ⟦retrieval-intelligence⟧ · ⟦retrieval-reviewer⟧ · ⟦rupert-giles-knowledge-steward⟧\n⚠ = boundary only","utf8_bytes":1024}},"scoped_estate_digest":"112cd95b4b6bdab173e881a2dc